WEBVTT

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:08.080
P-please, wait, Lady Loki!

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:11.290
The path beyond leads to
the sacred altar of Lord Uranus,

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.040
where he offers his prayers to keep the dungeon at bay!

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:21.040
Goddess or not, the Guild must maintain
absolute neutrality and this area is sacrosanct-

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:23.250
Don't be such a stiff!

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.670
I just wanna ask him one teensy question, ya know!

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:27.710
Absolutely not-
Ooh-hoo-hoo! Squishy squishy!

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:29.460
You mustn't-!
Ooh-hoo-hoo! Squishy squishy!

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:30.710
I'll allow it.

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:34.830
Royman, let her pass.

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:37.630
But, Lord Uran-

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:39.630
I said I will allow it.

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:43.290
Later!

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:07.330
What business do you have, Loki?

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:11.580
Yo, long time no see, Uranus.

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:03.290
Yep! Finally, a REAL enemy for me to hack at!

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:05.920
Hey, don't just stand there! They're still coming!

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:10.170
This blows.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:16.630
Forget the attack at Monsterphilia.
Where in the hell are all these things coming from?!

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:23.460
The flames will soon be unleashed.

00:03:24.460 --> 00:03:28.290
Creeping war, inescapable ruin.

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:32.420
The horn of battle echoes aloud.

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:36.130
Savage mayhem will envelope all.

00:03:39.210 --> 00:03:43.460
Bors! Gather up a team of fighters
while Riveria distracts them with her magic!

00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:45.920
If we strike in numbers, we can defeat them!

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:47.170
R-right!

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:57.420
There are too many...

00:03:57.880 --> 00:04:01.580
An ambush like this had to
have been orchestrated by someone.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:05.040
A Tamer... There must be a Tamer!

00:04:05.380 --> 00:04:08.000
What are those? What are they doing here?!

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:10.960
The town is under attack by monsters!

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:13.830
Let's catch up with Finn and the others.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:15.290
All right.

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:25.080
Lefiya, go on ahead of me!

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:26.960
Miss Ais!

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:44.170
That's Miss Riveria's magic...

00:04:56.170 --> 00:04:58.170
Who... are you?

00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:04.170
S-stop right there!

00:05:10.130 --> 00:05:11.460
Let her go!

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:19.250
Lu... lu...

00:05:26.210 --> 00:05:27.880
Miss Ais...

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:35.250
Lefiya, are you all right?

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:37.460
Y-yes.

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:41.380
Are you the one who murdered Hashana?

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:44.750
But the killer should be a woman...

00:05:45.710 --> 00:05:47.080
What if I am?

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:02.130
Was that from...

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:04.630
...from Hashana's corpse?!

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:08.000
It's easier to get around in a man's form.

00:06:10.920 --> 00:06:13.670
Thanks to this bloke I was able to go unnoticed.

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:20.750
Now hand over that seed.

00:06:24.130 --> 00:06:25.250
You're a tough one.

00:06:31.170 --> 00:06:32.250
She's strong!

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:38.880
Unleash a streak of light, bow and arrow of the holy tree.

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:41.170
Thou art a master of the bow.

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:46.330
Fire, O elven archer. May your arrow strike true!

00:06:49.210 --> 00:06:50.750
Arcs Ray!

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:57.460
How... with her bare hands?!

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:02.290
Lefiya!

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:09.500
Miss Ais is getting driven back!

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:11.130
At this rate...

00:07:11.830 --> 00:07:12.830
Miss Ais.

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:15.670
Stay down like a good girl.

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:17.710
Tempest!

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:30.630
That wind...

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:34.250
I see, you must be Aria then.

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:42.460
What did... she just call me?

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:47.170
Interesting. I found myself a souvenir.

00:08:14.500 --> 00:08:14.960
Run!

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:22.170
This year's Monsterphilia was a real shit show, wasn't it?

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:26.790
Seems like all sorts o' people are pointin' fingers
at the Guild, you bein' the organizers and all.

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:28.670
How you holdin' up?

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:32.920
Royman and the others are responsible
for the city's administration.

00:08:32.920 --> 00:08:35.380
It is none of my concern.

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:41.460
Now, now, don't say that. My Familia put a lotta effort
into stampin' out those monsters for ya.

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:45.040
We even fought those gross, freaky ones.

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:48.250
I wonder where the heck those monsters came from...

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:53.880
Kinda strange how they all just happened
to appear durin' the festival, huh?

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:58.830
Or, maybe that's the whole reason
it's put on in the first place...

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:01.420
Whaddya think about that?

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:04.790
What are you implying?

00:09:05.960 --> 00:09:10.080
Think the ones pullin' the strings... are in the Guild?

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:13.290
You are mistaken.

00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:18.920
Got it.

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:21.250
Sorry to interrupt ya...

00:09:22.130 --> 00:09:23.920
Keep up the good work!

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:49.580
What's THAT?!

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:52.750
Damn. Just when I thought we'd finally got rid of them.

00:09:53.710 --> 00:09:57.540
I'd love to figure out where these came from...

00:09:57.790 --> 00:10:00.250
But perhaps extermination should take priority.

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:02.000
Yes, that would be wise.

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:06.500
H-how the hell are you two so calm?!
Learn to panic a little!

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:09.500
Tempest.

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:15.670
It can sense her magic.

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:19.080
It seems like the monsters from before
have evolved into something new.

00:10:31.420 --> 00:10:32.380
Lefiya!

00:10:32.380 --> 00:10:34.830
Remember that combo we've used in the past?

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:35.830
We're using it!

00:10:35.830 --> 00:10:37.250
G-got it!

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:39.210
Everyone!

00:10:43.630 --> 00:10:47.580
There's nothing else I can do about the seed...
But I'll be taking you with me at least.

00:10:50.130 --> 00:10:50.920
Ais!

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:52.500
Ah, c'mon!

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:57.250
These things just keep on comin'
no matter how many I slice up!

00:10:57.750 --> 00:11:00.710
Its Magic Stone must be buried
somewhere within the upper body.

00:11:01.540 --> 00:11:04.670
Perhaps this is a job for the spellcasters after all.

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:08.880
Could I overtake her with my "Aerial"?

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:11.670
No. I can hardly keep her at bay as it is.

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:19.330
Pretty useful wind you've got there, Aria.

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:21.330
Where did you hear that name?

00:11:22.170 --> 00:11:23.250
I wonder.

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:28.750
Harbinger of the end...

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:32.670
White snow, swirl and twist before the twilight.

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:39.710
Darkening light, frozen earth.

00:11:39.710 --> 00:11:41.750
Storm of snow, three bitter...

00:11:48.750 --> 00:11:50.000
Lefiya, now!

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:54.960
Make them fall like rain and turn the savages to ash.

00:11:55.670 --> 00:11:57.420
Fusillade Fallarica!

00:12:05.380 --> 00:12:07.040
You did it, Lefiya!

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:11.210
They used Riveria's spell as a decoy
in their combo! Nice move!

00:12:13.380 --> 00:12:14.170
It's running away?!

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:19.250
I thought you had a face like a doll.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.080
You're not getting away!

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:35.500
Here I come!

00:12:45.750 --> 00:12:46.920
Take that!

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:48.420
Tiona, you idiot!

00:12:48.420 --> 00:12:51.040
You let the Magic Stone blast apart with the body!

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:52.000
Oops.

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:59.630
I c-can't... move my body...

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:01.250
It's over.

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:05.130
M-move... move!

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:08.540
What?!

00:13:08.750 --> 00:13:10.960
You won't harm another hair...

00:13:11.170 --> 00:13:12.670
...on our Princess' head.

00:13:13.420 --> 00:13:14.460
Miss Ais!

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:16.500
Are you all right?

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:18.000
Riveria...

00:13:18.580 --> 00:13:20.710
Lefiya, I need you to heal Ais!

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:21.710
Yes, Ma'am!

00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:24.920
Are you the Tamer who commanded these monsters?

00:13:25.290 --> 00:13:27.420
Confident enough to chat, are you?

00:13:27.880 --> 00:13:29.420
Why, not nearly as much as you.

00:13:32.420 --> 00:13:34.380
Don't get cocky, Brat!

00:13:41.290 --> 00:13:41.920
You son of a-

00:13:46.670 --> 00:13:47.630
Finn.

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:48.920
She broke my finger.

00:13:52.250 --> 00:13:53.960
First Class...

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:57.830
Lv.5, no, 6...

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:00.750
The odds aren't in my favor today.

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:03.670
Miss Ais!

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:13.830
She got away.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:28.460
That sudden visit from Lady Loki gave me quite a fright.

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:31.380
Is that you, Fels?

00:14:32.670 --> 00:14:36.670
This is not the first time
the gods have behaved erratically.

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:42.250
But was it purely impulsive?
Or did someone knowingly instigate this...?

00:14:44.580 --> 00:14:50.210
In any case, making her our enemy now
would not be wise.

00:14:53.420 --> 00:14:55.000
I am aware.

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:02.960
It's been six days.

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:06.420
We've come this far, and still no clues?

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:12.170
The killer may have escaped,
but she'll probably be laying low for a while.

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:16.830
I'm sure it'll take her some time to train new monsters.

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:20.080
That Tamer was super strong, right?

00:15:20.290 --> 00:15:21.290
Yes.

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:25.460
To want something so badly that you'd kill people for it...

00:15:26.460 --> 00:15:28.960
What in the world was that crystal orb thing?

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:36.130
Hmm, I've got a few ideas I want to look into,
but unfortunately there isn't much we can do right now.

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:37.630
I agree.

00:15:58.080 --> 00:16:00.630
We're leaving, Aria.

00:16:10.710 --> 00:16:12.380
'Morning, Ais!

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:15.130
We're heading out soon. You all right?

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:28.380
Ais, you haven't really eaten anything
these last few days. Sure you're all right?

00:16:28.830 --> 00:16:31.250
I've still got some rations left!

00:16:31.750 --> 00:16:35.210
Thanks... but I'm fine.

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:44.000
Whoa, this room's huge!

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:52.500
Finn, I'll handle this.

00:16:52.710 --> 00:16:53.540
Ais?!

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:58.290
I feel like Ais has been a little scary since that battle.

00:17:03.630 --> 00:17:05.080
She was strong...

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:07.460
If only I were stronger...

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:14.290
Oh my...

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:17.380
Riveria, have you heard anything from her?

00:17:17.380 --> 00:17:19.540
That Tamer was strong, I'll give her that,

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:21.960
but one defeat shouldn't be enough
to affect Ais this much.

00:17:21.960 --> 00:17:23.210
I have nothing.

00:17:23.330 --> 00:17:26.830
The only words I've gotten out of her are "It's nothing."

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:29.750
Hmm... That is a concern.

00:17:29.960 --> 00:17:33.830
Um, Boss? Miss Riveria?

00:17:34.580 --> 00:17:40.170
Is Miss Ais going to be okay?
Is there anything I can do to help...?

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:41.380
Food.

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:42.420
What?!

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:47.670
The moment she looks like she's hungry,
swoop in and attempt to feed her.

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:48.920
It might help her relax.

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:51.920
Wh-what? F-f-feed her?!

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:58.880
Here you go, Miss Ais. Say "ahh."

00:17:59.130 --> 00:18:00.630
Ahhh.

00:18:03.540 --> 00:18:05.500
I c-couldn't possibly do that!

00:18:10.960 --> 00:18:13.330
She wiped out every last one of 'em all by herself.

00:18:13.330 --> 00:18:17.290
She'd be a lot cuter if she appeared
to need our help sometimes.

00:18:17.750 --> 00:18:19.670
Alrighty, great job there!

00:18:19.670 --> 00:18:21.790
Need a potion? An elixir?

00:18:21.790 --> 00:18:23.960
Oh! You must be hungry, right?

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:28.960
I've got some of your favorite
azuki cream flavor Potato Poppers!

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:32.790
Miss Tiona?! That was supposed to be MY job!

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:36.630
Miss Ais, would you like to try
some of my favorite snacks?

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:38.960
Where do we go from here, Finn?

00:18:38.960 --> 00:18:41.830
Hmm, maybe we should head back soon.

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:44.250
I've got some things I need to report to Loki,

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:46.420
and we're starting to run low on rations anyway.

00:18:46.630 --> 00:18:47.790
True.

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:50.130
Everyone, we're moving out.

00:18:50.130 --> 00:18:51.420
Okay!
Okay...

00:18:56.790 --> 00:18:58.960
Finn, Riveria.

00:19:01.790 --> 00:19:03.960
I'd like to stay behind, alone.

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:08.880
I don't need any rations.

00:19:09.170 --> 00:19:12.710
I won't cause you any trouble... so please...

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:16.750
W-wait! You're not serious, are you, Ais?

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:21.380
We can't just abandon a party member
all alone in the deeper levels. It's too dangerous!

00:19:24.670 --> 00:19:26.960
Finn, I'll ask on her behalf as well.

00:19:26.960 --> 00:19:28.460
Riveria?!

00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:30.580
The way things are now, she won't listen anyway.

00:19:31.040 --> 00:19:33.500
And you're asking me to allow that behavior?

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:37.040
Then I will stay as well. Is that more agreeable?

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:40.920
Fine, then. I'll allow it.

00:19:41.130 --> 00:19:42.210
Boss!

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:45.250
I'm sure she'll be fine with Riveria by her side.

00:19:45.380 --> 00:19:48.420
What? Finn, convince them to come with us!

00:19:48.420 --> 00:19:53.330
Th-then I'll stay behind too!
I promise I won't hold you back!

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:55.540
Right! Then I'm staying too!

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:57.000
You can't.

00:19:57.000 --> 00:20:02.500
Ais and Riveria are one thing, but if you two remain,
there won't be enough rations.

00:20:05.420 --> 00:20:07.710
Riveria, can I have a word?

00:20:13.170 --> 00:20:16.670
So, what's the real reason behind that suggestion?

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:18.880
You can't expect me to believe all that.

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:23.420
Even if we were to stop her now,
we'd only be delaying the inevitable.

00:20:23.420 --> 00:20:25.580
She's bound to explode sooner or later.

00:20:26.540 --> 00:20:30.210
Personally, I'd rather have her blow up
where I can see her.

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:33.170
I see, I underestimated you.

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:40.880
I don't think that Tamer is going to show up again
any time soon, but be careful nonetheless.

00:20:41.630 --> 00:20:48.210
I'll leave all of the Magic Potions I have with you.
You're the one who agreed to Ais' proposal.

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:52.210
You'll be just as responsible
for whatever happens as her.

00:20:54.420 --> 00:20:57.500
I understand, and I'm sorry...

00:20:58.670 --> 00:20:59.790
Thank you.

00:21:05.920 --> 00:21:07.580
Thank you, Riveria.

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:12.080
Just don't make things difficult for me. I'll leave it at that.

00:21:13.670 --> 00:21:14.750
I'm sorry...

00:21:25.960 --> 00:21:26.920
Something's coming...

00:21:35.210 --> 00:21:38.500
It's here... the Floor Boss.

00:21:39.540 --> 00:21:42.000
The Monster Rex Udaeus.

00:21:46.960 --> 00:21:49.420
Riveria, I'm doing this alone.

00:23:37.960 --> 00:23:39.710
"Subjugation and Escape"
